msgid "# Shared host-backed Engram"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This opt-in path lets independent DeepSeek V4.1 instances map the same\n"
"read-only INT8 Engram tables on supported A3 systems. A separate owner loads\n"
"the tables into MemFabric BM host DRAM. Consumers join the BM group and use\n"
"the existing NPU gather/dequantization kernel; only selected BF16 results are\n"
"materialized in HBM. This does not remove model collectives or KV transfer."
msgstr ""
"此可选启用路径允许独立的 DeepSeek V4.1 实例在受支持的 A3 系统上映射相同的只读 INT8 Engram 表。一个独立的 owner "
"将表加载到 MemFabric BM 主机 DRAM 中。消费者加入 BM 组并使用现有的 NPU gather/反量化内核；只有选定的 BF16 "
"结果会被物化到 HBM 中。这不会移除模型集合通信或 KV 传输。"

msgid ""
"The default remains unchanged. Without `shared_engram`, existing\n"
"HBM and host-offload paths retain their normal behavior."
msgstr "默认行为保持不变。未启用 `shared_engram` 时，现有的 HBM 和主机卸载路径保持其正常行为。"

msgid "## Requirements"
msgstr "## 要求"

msgid ""
"- A3 devices with CANN Fabric-handle support and working cross-node host-memory\n"
"  imports. Same-supernode placement alone is not sufficient proof of support.\n"
"- MemFabric BM with `create2`, dynamic membership and `gva_to_va` support.\n"
"  No custom VMM library or additional CMake target is required.\n"
"- A correctly packaged MemFabric wheel containing the upstream duplicate-library\n"
"  loading fix (memfabric_hybrid commit `cafd1251`). Older wheels can load two\n"
"  copies of native libraries and abort during process teardown. Check clean\n"
"  startup/shutdown before using a new image; the version string alone does not\n"
"  establish that the packaging fix is included.\n"
"- An immutable, identical checkpoint on every instance. Supported tables use\n"
"  INT8 codes of width256 and group32 scales; the owner converts scales to FP32.\n"
"- A trusted network reachable by the owner and consumers. Control connections\n"
"  do not authenticate peers or encrypt traffic; no network isolation is implied."
msgstr ""
"- 支持 CANN Fabric-handle 且跨节点主机内存导入可正常工作的 A3 设备。仅处于同一超级节点并不足以证明支持。\n"
"- 支持 `create2`、动态成员关系和 `gva_to_va` 的 MemFabric BM。无需自定义 VMM 库或额外的 CMake 目标。\n"
"- 正确打包的 MemFabric wheel，包含上游的重复库加载修复（memfabric_hybrid 提交 `cafd1251`）。较旧的 wheel 可能加载两份原生库副本，并在进程退出时中止。使用新镜像前请检查启动/关闭是否干净；仅凭版本字符串无法确定是否包含该打包修复。\n"
"- 每个实例上都有不可变且完全相同的 checkpoint。支持的表使用宽度为 256 的 INT8 编码和 group32 缩放；owner 将缩放转换为 FP32。\n"
"- owner 和消费者均可访问的可信网络。控制连接不会对对端进行身份验证，也不会加密流量；不隐含任何网络隔离。"

msgid "## Start and attach"
msgstr "## 启动与接入"

msgid "Shared host Engram requires Model Runner V2."
msgstr "共享主机 Engram 需要 Model Runner V2。"

msgid ""
"Start the owner in a supervised process, using an address reachable from every\n"
"consumer:"
msgstr "在受监管的进程中启动 owner，使用每个消费者均可访问的地址："

msgid ""
"Wait for `POOL_READY`. The owner must remain alive independently of all model\n"
"servers. The BM store uses an available port on the endpoint host by default;\n"
"use `--store-url tcp://OWNER_ADDRESS:PORT` when an explicit port is needed.\n"
"The owner control endpoint and BM store endpoint must use distinct ports and\n"
"both must be reachable by consumers. Use a concrete address rather than a\n"
"wildcard as the advertised endpoint.\n"
"`--max-consumers 64` reserves room for the owner plus 64 worker processes,\n"
"enough for three DP4/TP4 prefills and one DP8/TP2 decoder. Two Engram layers in\n"
"one worker share a process-wide BM session and use separate BM objects.\n"
"Another subsystem in that process must not initialize the BM singleton with a\n"
"different store; MemFabric TransferEngine has a separate API."
msgstr ""
"等待 `POOL_READY`。owner 必须独立于所有模型服务器保持存活。BM store "
"默认使用端点主机上的一个可用端口；当需要显式指定端口时，使用 `--store-url tcp://OWNER_ADDRESS:PORT`。owner "
"控制端点和 BM store 端点必须使用不同的端口，且两者都必须可被消费者访问。请使用具体地址而非通配符作为对外公布的端点。`--max-"
"consumers 64` 为 owner 加上 64 个工作进程预留了空间，足以支持三个 DP4/TP4 prefill 和一个 DP8/TP2 "
"decoder。一个工作进程中的两个 Engram 层共享一个进程级 BM 会话，并使用独立的 BM 对象。该进程中的其他子系统不得用不同的 store"
" 初始化 BM 单例；MemFabric TransferEngine 有独立的 API。"

msgid ""
"Consumers initialize the model's AICPU metadata scheduler before creating BM\n"
"mappings. On the tested A3 stack, starting that scheduler after remote mappings\n"
"failed `halMemBindSibling` and stalled FULL decode graph capture. The deterministic\n"
"startup warmup uses the existing metadata operator once per worker; it does not\n"
"modify model weights, sampling state or the inference graph. Both Engram layer\n"
"clients keep the same BM session alive throughout the model lifetime."
msgstr ""
"消费者在创建 BM 映射之前初始化模型的 AICPU 元数据调度器。在测试过的 A3 平台上，在远程映射之后启动该调度器会导致 "
"`halMemBindSibling` 失败，并使 FULL decode "
"图捕获停滞。确定性的启动预热在每个工作进程中调用一次现有的元数据算子；它不会修改模型权重、采样状态或推理图。两个 Engram "
"层客户端在整个模型生命周期内保持同一个 BM 会话存活。"

msgid "Add these options to each server's otherwise unchanged launch:"
msgstr "在保持其他部分不变的每个服务器启动命令中添加这些选项："

msgid ""
"Merge this key into any existing additional configuration; do not replace\n"
"other model settings. Consumers validate identity and layout, import their TP\n"
"row views, and skip reloading shared table parameters. Consumers contribute zero\n"
"local DRAM/HBM table capacity. MemFabric handles allocation, membership and\n"
"mapping; a one-time `gva_to_va(..., LOCAL_DEVICE)` resolution supplies the NPU\n"
"pointer table. Runtime lookup is still a direct load plus dequantization into\n"
"selected BF16 HBM rows, with no BM copy/staging call or per-request GVA query.\n"
"Different TP layouts\n"
"can use the same physical backing. Request scheduling, token IDs, and KV state\n"
"remain independent. Dummy loading and sleep mode are not supported."
msgstr ""
"将此键合并到任何现有的附加配置中；不要替换其他模型设置。消费者验证身份和布局，导入其 TP 行视图，并跳过重新加载共享表参数。消费者贡献零本地 "
"DRAM/HBM 表容量。MemFabric 负责分配、成员关系和映射；一次性的 `gva_to_va(..., LOCAL_DEVICE)` 解析提供"
" NPU 指针表。运行时查找仍然是直接加载并反量化到选定的 BF16 HBM 行，没有 BM 复制/暂存调用或每请求的 GVA 查询。不同的 TP "
"布局可以共用同一物理后端。请求调度、token ID 和 KV 状态保持独立。不支持 dummy loading 和 sleep 模式。"

msgid "## Shutdown, recovery, and fallback"
msgstr "## 关闭、恢复与回退"

msgid ""
"Stop request admission and shut down consumers before stopping the owner.\n"
"Mappings must be synchronized and released before their control lease is\n"
"acknowledged. Graceful owner shutdown enters draining, refuses new consumers,\n"
"and waits for existing leases rather than freeing live backing memory."
msgstr ""
"在停止 owner 之前，先停止请求准入并关闭消费者。映射必须在其控制租约被确认之前完成同步并释放。owner 的优雅关闭会进入 draining "
"状态，拒绝新的消费者，并等待现有租约，而不是释放仍在使用的后端内存。"

msgid ""
"Unexpected consumer disconnection conservatively retains an orphaned lease.\n"
"Do not force-stop the owner while another consumer may still access its table.\n"
"For orphan recovery, stop and verify termination of **all** consumers of that\n"
"generation, then terminate the owner and create a fresh generation. Never reuse\n"
"stale generation metadata. Automatic orphan reclamation and transparent owner\n"
"failover are not implemented. Active-graph owner-failure behavior still needs\n"
"hardware validation before production use."
msgstr ""
"消费者意外断开连接时会保守地保留一个孤立租约。当另一个消费者可能仍在访问其表时，不要强制停止 "
"owner。对于孤立租约恢复，请停止并确认该代际的**所有**消费者均已终止，然后终止 owner "
"并创建一个新的代际。切勿复用陈旧的代际元数据。未实现自动孤立租约回收和透明的 owner 故障转移。活动图场景下的 owner "
"故障行为在生产使用前仍需硬件验证。"

msgid ""
"To fall back, restart consumers without `shared_engram`. Budget for\n"
"the original per-instance table replicas before doing so. Preserve the owner\n"
"until all shared consumers are gone."
msgstr ""
"要回退，请在不启用 `shared_engram` 的情况下重启消费者。在此之前，请为原始的每实例表副本预留资源。在所有共享消费者消失之前，请保留 "
"owner。"

msgid "## Current MemFabric validation"
msgstr "## 当前 MemFabric 验证"

msgid ""
"The full-model numbers below used the earlier shared-directory discovery path;\n"
"they are not endpoint-bootstrap measurements."
msgstr "下面的全模型数据使用了较早的共享目录发现路径；它们不是端点引导（endpoint-bootstrap）测量结果。"

msgid ""
"CPU protocol and storage tests use fake BM allocation and real control sockets.\n"
"They cover publication bounds, zero-consumer allocation requests, metadata-only\n"
"views, live-view release rejection and retry after a failed leave. Real A3\n"
"component tests exercised a persistent owner, two layers/four BM objects,\n"
"two per-layer clients sharing one BM session, native gather/dequantization,\n"
"graph replay and continued reads after one layer's client detached.\n"
"The tested deployment used a repaired 1.2.0 wheel with a single canonical\n"
"native library set; native ELF code was unchanged. This packaging repair is\n"
"not shipped by this PR, and deployment needs a correctly packaged MemFabric."
msgstr ""
"CPU 协议和存储测试使用伪造的 BM "
"分配和真实的控制套接字。它们覆盖发布边界、零消费者分配请求、仅元数据视图、活动视图释放拒绝以及失败离开后的重试。真实 A3 组件测试验证了持久化 "
"owner、两个层/四个 BM 对象、两个每层客户端共享一个 BM 会话、原生 "
"gather/反量化、图重放以及某一层的客户端分离后继续读取。测试部署使用了修复后的 1.2.0 wheel，其中包含单一规范的原生库集合；原生 ELF"
" 代码未更改。此打包修复未包含在本 PR 中，部署需要正确打包的 MemFabric。"

msgid ""
"A full-model GVA comparison ran on four A3 servers in one physical supernode,\n"
"with CANN 9.2, torch-npu 2.10 and 64 NPUs: three DP4/TP4 prefills and one\n"
"DP8/TP2 decoder. Both native host offload and GVA completed 1440/1440 requests\n"
"without errors. One owner held two checkpoint tables/four BM HOST objects;\n"
"64 workers attached 128 layer views with zero local table capacity.\n"
"Table backing fell from approximately 824 GiB to 208 GiB; consumers had no\n"
"large POSIX table replicas. This is table storage, not total memory or HBM."
msgstr ""
"全模型 GVA 对比在一个物理超节点中的四台 A3 服务器上运行，\n"
"使用 CANN 9.2、torch-npu 2.10 和 64 个 NPU：三个 DP4/TP4 预填充和一个\n"
"DP8/TP2 解码器。原生主机卸载和 GVA 均完成了 1440/1440 个请求\n"
"且无错误。一个 owner 持有两张 checkpoint 表/四个 BM HOST 对象；\n"
"64 个 worker 附加了 128 个层视图，本地表容量为零。\n"
"表后备存储从约 824 GiB 降至 208 GiB；消费者没有\n"
"大型 POSIX 表副本。这是表存储，而非总内存或 HBM。"

msgid ""
"| Prompt bucket | Concurrency | Native QPS | GVA QPS | GVA TTFT P50 (s) | "
"GVA TPOT P50/P90 (ms) |"
msgstr ""
"| Prompt 分桶 | 并发数 | 原生 QPS | GVA QPS | GVA TTFT P50 (s) | GVA TPOT P50/P90 "
"(ms) |"

msgid ""
"Each case used three closed-loop waves, a 700-token cap, 24 warmup requests,\n"
"and backend prefix-cache reset. All paired request hashes and prompt-token\n"
"counts matched. The cache-hit label names a dataset, not a measured hit rate.\n"
"This single sequential A/B supports broadly unchanged throughput; it does not\n"
"prove a stable speedup. Both baseline (8.007s) and GVA (8.182s) missed the\n"
"20–40K TTFT target of 7s. Full SLO acceptance and model-quality validation\n"
"remain open. The private request corpus is not distributed with this change."
msgstr ""
"每个用例使用三轮闭环波次、700 token 上限、24 个预热请求，\n"
"并重置后端前缀缓存。所有配对请求哈希和 prompt token\n"
"数量均匹配。缓存命中标签仅表示数据集名称，而非实测命中率。\n"
"这一单次顺序 A/B 测试支持吞吐量基本不变；但并不能\n"
"证明存在稳定的加速。基线（8.007s）和 GVA（8.182s）均未达到\n"
"20–40K TTFT 的 7s 目标。完整的 SLO 验收和模型质量验证\n"
"仍未完成。私有请求语料不随此变更分发。"

msgid ""
"The hardware run used Engram leaf-module overlays on a pinned model runtime,\n"
"not a newly built complete framework wheel. Initializing the metadata AICPU\n"
"operator before remote BM imports resolved a reproducible decode graph-capture\n"
"stall; FULL decode graphs were retained. The tested prototype initialized\n"
"before embedding construction; the implementation narrows this to the shared\n"
"allocation branch before the first client attaches. Active-graph owner failure\n"
"and arbitrary BM teardown/reinitialization remain unvalidated."
msgstr ""
"硬件运行在固定版本的模型运行时上使用 Engram 叶子模块覆盖层，\n"
"而非新构建的完整框架 wheel。在远程 BM 导入之前初始化元数据 AICPU\n"
"算子解决了可复现的解码图捕获\n"
"停滞问题；FULL 解码图得以保留。测试原型在\n"
"嵌入构建之前初始化；实现将此收窄到第一个客户端附加之前的共享\n"
"分配分支。活动图 owner 故障\n"
"和任意 BM 拆除/重新初始化仍未验证。"

msgid ""
"The component benchmark can be reproduced with the following two commands in\n"
"separate terminals on a supported, correctly packaged A3 environment. Choose a\n"
"local benchmark root, wait for `POOL_READY`, then start consumers:"
msgstr ""
"组件基准测试可在受支持且正确打包的 A3 环境中，通过以下两条命令在\n"
"独立终端中复现。选择一个\n"
"本地基准根目录，等待 `POOL_READY`，然后启动消费者："

msgid ""
"Repeat the consumer command with distinct tags to exercise fresh processes.\n"
"Stop all consumers before creating `/tmp/engram-bm-smoke/stop` to\n"
"shut down this benchmark owner. This uses small warm tables; its HBM/GVA lookup\n"
"timings are not full-model throughput or DRAM bandwidth-ceiling measurements.\n"
"The real model owner remains `python -m vllm_ascend.shared_engram` above."
msgstr ""
"使用不同的标签重复消费者命令以运行全新进程。\n"
"在创建 `/tmp/engram-bm-smoke/stop` 之前停止所有消费者，以\n"
"关闭此基准测试 owner。这使用小型热表；其 HBM/GVA 查找\n"
"耗时并非全模型吞吐量或 DRAM 带宽上限测量。\n"
"真正的模型 owner 仍为上述 `python -m vllm_ascend.shared_engram`。"

msgid "## Historical VMM validation"
msgstr "## 历史 VMM 验证"

msgid ""
"CPU protocol tests are in `tests/ut/models/test_engram_shared_pool.py`. They\n"
"exercise real control sockets with a fake allocator; they do not establish\n"
"hardware correctness. A3 validation has exercised remote native lookup,\n"
"independent detach/reattach, actual checkpoint rows, and embedding graph replay.\n"
"The previous raw-VMM backend's full-model P/D was tested on four A3 nodes in one physical supernode, with\n"
"CANN9.2 and torch-npu2.10. The pinned deployment used three DP4/TP4 prefills\n"
"and one DP8/TP2 decoder, native INT8 lookup and the same KV connector for both\n"
"placements. Both runs completed1440/1440 requests without errors. Physical\n"
"table backing fell from approximately824GiB to208GiB. This is table storage,\n"
"not total system memory or HBM usage."
msgstr ""
"CPU 协议测试位于 `tests/ut/models/test_engram_shared_pool.py`。它们\n"
"使用假分配器测试真实控制套接字；但并不能确立\n"
"硬件正确性。A3 验证已测试远程原生查找、\n"
"独立分离/重新附加、实际 checkpoint 行以及嵌入图重放。\n"
"之前的 raw-VMM 后端的全模型 P/D 在一个物理超节点中的四个 A3 节点上进行了测试，\n"
"使用 CANN9.2 和 torch-npu2.10。固定部署使用三个 DP4/TP4 预填充\n"
"和一个 DP8/TP2 解码器、原生 INT8 查找，且两种\n"
"部署均使用相同的 KV 连接器。两次运行均完成了 1440/1440 个请求且无错误。物理\n"
"表后备存储从约 824GiB 降至 208GiB。这是表存储，\n"
"而非总系统内存或 HBM 使用量。"

msgid ""
"| Prompt bucket | Concurrency | Native QPS | Shared QPS | Shared TTFT P50 "
"(s) | Shared TPOT P50/P90 (ms) |"
msgstr ""
"| Prompt 分桶 | 并发数 | 原生 QPS | 共享 QPS | 共享 TTFT P50 (s) | 共享 TPOT P50/P90 (ms)"
" |"

msgid ""
"Each case used three closed-loop waves, a700-token cap,24 warmup requests and\n"
"backend prefix-cache reset. Paired request hashes and prompt-token counts\n"
"matched. The cache-hit label identifies the dataset, not a measured hit rate.\n"
"This single sequential A/B shows no observed QPS regression; it does not prove\n"
"a stable speedup. The20–40K TTFT target of7s was missed by both baseline7.640s\n"
"and shared8.238s. Full SLO acceptance and owner-failure validation remain open.\n"
"The private request corpus is not distributed with this change; reproduce\n"
"performance using a representative corpus and report workload differences."
msgstr ""
"每个用例使用三轮闭环波次、700 token 上限、24 个预热请求，\n"
"并重置后端前缀缓存。配对请求哈希和 prompt token 数量\n"
"均匹配。缓存命中标签仅表示数据集名称，而非实测命中率。\n"
"这一单次顺序 A/B 测试显示未观察到 QPS 回退；但并不能证明\n"
"存在稳定的加速。20–40K TTFT 的 7s 目标在基线 7.640s\n"
"和共享 8.238s 中均未达到。完整的 SLO 验收和 owner 故障验证仍未完成。\n"
"私有请求语料不随此变更分发；请使用具有代表性的语料复现\n"
"性能，并报告工作负载差异。"
